5,1,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. I want to make sure we choose a program that is sustainable for the long term. Let's look at the data carefully.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. It would be wise to understand the outcomes of our previous efforts before we commit to something new.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I think we should consider the actual workload of the staff. It's easy to overlook the pressure on the ground.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,Sustainability is a vague term. I'm more interested in the actual financial viability and the hidden costs that usually surface later.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. I just hope we can find a way to add something lovely without making the day too hectic for everyone.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, that's a fair point. I'm worried about programs that look good on paper but fail because the supporting partners aren't truly committed.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,Perhaps we should look into the records of our past trials to see where the gaps were.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I'll be looking into the staffing levels. We can't implement a new program if the teams are already at their limit.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,Exactly. I'll be checking the ledger and the tariffs. I want to see what we can actually afford to build and maintain.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I agree with Misaki. I'm a bit worried about the physical space and how people get here. We wouldn't want the hallways to become too crowded.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Midori,,I think I'll look into the readmission figures and the data agreements. I want to see if our outside partners are actually following through.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will focus on the readmission figures from the call-back trial and the shared nursing round results.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I'll check the ward nursing vacancies and the therapy and midwifery staffing review.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,I've already decided. I'll stick to the ledger and the regional fund tariffs. Let's see if the numbers actually add up this time.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I think I shall look into the rooms, parking and shuttle coverage, and also what the booking system records. I want to be sure we have space.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
